---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
	seo={{
		title: "Mohammad Hossein Mirzaei",
		description:
			"Personal website of Mohammad Hossein Mirzaei, software engineer.",
		image: "/images/me_100x100.webp",
		imageAlt: "Mohammad Hossein Mirzaei",
	}}
>
    <section class="flex flex-col gap-4 contained mx-auto mt-[10svh] md:mt-[20svh]">
        <!-- profile -->
        <div class="flex flex-nowrap items-center gap-4">
            <picture
                class="size-16 md:size-20 rounded-2xl md:rounded-3xl overflow-hidden bg-linear-to-t from-[#635C3B] to-[#7B7247]"
            >
                <img
                    src="/images/me_100x100.webp"
                    alt="Mohammad Hossein Mirzaei"
                    class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center drop-shadow mt-2"
                />
            </picture>

            <div class="flex flex-col">
                <h1 class="font-bold">Mohammad Hossein Mirzaei</h1>
                <p class="text-base-content/70">Software Engineer</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- info -->
        <div class="prose px-3 flex flex-col gap-4">
            <p>
                I'm Mohammad Hossein, a <b>creative and curious software engineer</b>.
                I first became interested in programming in 2013 and started
                working professionally in 2017. Since then, I've had the
                opportunity to build a number of
                <a
                    href="/en/works"
                    class="badge bg-base-300 fill-base-content mx-1 font-bold transition-all hover:text-primary hover:fill-primary focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary"
                >
                    <svg
                        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                        height="16px"
                        width="16px"
                        viewBox="0 -960 960 960"
                        aria-hidden="true"
                    >
                        <path
                            d="M160-120q-33 0-56.5-23.5T80-200v-440q0-33 23.5-56.5T160-720h160v-80q0-33 23.5-56.5T400-880h160q33 0 56.5 23.5T640-800v80h160q33 0 56.5 23.5T880-640v440q0 33-23.5 56.5T800-120H160Zm240-600h160v-80H400v80Z"
                        ></path>
                    </svg>
                    <span>projects</span>
                </a>
                and products.
            </p>

            <p>
                In 2023, I also became interested in <b>psychology and
                psychoanalysis</b>. This led me to explore the field of
                 <b> health and well-being</b>, eventually inspiring me to
                create
                <a
                    href="/en/works/asouda"
                    class="badge bg-base-300 mx-1 font-bold transition-all hover:text-primary focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary"
                >
                    <img
                        src="/images/asouda_30x30.webp"
                        alt=""
                        class="size-4"
                    />
                    <span>Asouda</span>
                </a>
                in 2026.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- links -->
        <div
            class="flex flex-nowrap items-center gap-2 bg-base-300 rounded-2xl p-1 transition-all hover:rounded-full w-fit"
        >
            <!-- linkedin -->
            <a
                href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/mohammad-hossein-mirzaei-2772aa1ab/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm grow rounded-full"
            >
                Linkedin
            </a>

            <!-- dribbble -->
            <a
                href="https://dribbble.com/mhmirzaei/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm grow rounded-full"
            >
                Dribbble
            </a>

            <!-- github -->
            <a
                href="https://github.com/mirzawho/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm grow rounded-full"
            >
                Github
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>